confirm.description:
In the skill's configuration page, fill in:

- Authorize URL: {authorize_url}
- Token URL: {token_url}
- WebService: {webservice_url}
- Callback URL: {callback_url} (already shown by the platform)
- Client_Id / ClientSecret: the values from the previous step

Click Submit once done.

reconfigure.description:
Client_Id / ClientSecret must match the values in the xiaodu console.

- Authorize URL: {authorize_url}
- Token URL: {token_url}
- WebService: {webservice_url}

The callback URL is accepted on both the production (xiaodu.baidu.com) and debug (xiaodu-dbp.baidu.com) hosts automatically, so no separate debug address needs to be configured.
